  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_0162.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Ma&ntilde;ana dedicada a las mujeres en las fiestas del Arrabal del Castillo de Onda, conquista de la fortaleza y pasillo a muna novia y un novio incluidas, tras el almuerzo y antes de los toros de la tarde, embolados por la noche, uno de ellos dedicado a Edu Mart&iacute; Marco, joven fallecido recientemente. Todo en 238 fotos.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdissabtefestesravalcastell14/img_0122.jpg\" alt=\"img_0122\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdissabtefestesravalcastell14/img_0123.jpg\" alt=\"img_0123\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdissabtefestesravalcastell14/img_0124.jpg\" alt=\"img_0124\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdissabtefestesravalcastell14/img_0125.jpg\" alt=\"img_0125\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdissabtefestesravalcastell14/img_0126.jpg\" alt=\"img_0126\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdissabtefestesravalcastell14/img_0127.jpg\" alt=\"img_0127\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdissabtefestesravalcastell14/img_0129.jpg\" alt=\"img_0129\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdissabtefestesravalcastell14/img_0130.jpg\" alt=\"img_